{"slug":"reflection-beam-501b","title":"Reflection previews Beam 501B","narration":"Reflection just previewed Beam, a 501-billion-parameter open-weight model that only activates 23 billion parameters per token. The scale behind it is ridiculous: 23.8 trillion pretraining tokens, then more than 100 million reinforcement-learning rollouts on 10,500 NVIDIA GB300 GPUs over four weeks. Reflection says Beam focuses on coding, reasoning and agentic work, with one-million-token context after midtraining. But there is one important asterisk: the weights are not actually downloadable yet. Beam is still in final red-teaming, with an Apache 2.0 release promised later this month. So this is open weight, currently with a very large “coming soon” sticker.","beats":[{"text":"Reflection just previewed Beam,","editorialRole":"setup","visual":{"type":"source","sourceIndex":0,"query":"Reflection Beam 501B open weight model","mustMatch":["beam","501"]},"sfx":"whoosh"},{"text":"a 501-billion-parameter open-weight model","editorialRole":"fact","visual":{"type":"metric","value":"501B TOTAL"}},{"text":"that only activates 23 billion parameters per token.","editorialRole":"explanation","visual":{"type":"explain","mode":"capacity","load":4.6,"labels":["501B TOTAL","23B ACTIVE"]}},{"text":"The scale behind it is ridiculous:","editorialRole":"reaction","visual":{"type":"kinetic","text":"THE SCALE IS RIDICULOUS","emphasis":"RIDICULOUS"},"memeIntent":{"purpose":"reaction","tone":"chaotic","intensity":2,"preferredMedia":"image","presentation":"overlay","maxDurationSeconds":0.9,"concepts":["huge","disbelief","reaction"]}},{"text":"23.8 trillion pretraining tokens,","editorialRole":"fact","visual":{"type":"source","sourceIndex":0,"query":"Beam 23.8 trillion pretraining tokens","mustMatch":["beam"],"allowReuse":true}},{"text":"then more than 100 million reinforcement-learning rollouts","editorialRole":"fact","visual":{"type":"source","sourceIndex":0,"query":"Beam reinforcement learning 100 million ro